{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 5.46, "text": "We just bought a duplex in Florida, got a three and three-quarter percent interest rate."}, {"start": 5.78, "end": 8.28, "text": "It's crazy because the builder will pay that."}, {"start": 9.12, "end": 14.12, "text": "Now that rates are coming down, I don't know that builders will be as desperate to do that"}, {"start": 14.12, "end": 16.38, "text": "because I think there's going to be a big frenzy."}, {"start": 16.68, "end": 19.22, "text": "We're just on the verge of the market shifting again."}, {"start": 19.94, "end": 24.58, "text": "So what I did over the past year may not work for the next year because I think we're"}, {"start": 24.58, "end": 28.42, "text": "going to be headed into a time when there's going to be more competition, a little bit"}, {"start": 28.42, "end": 28.62, "text": "harder."}, {"start": 28.62, "end": 28.7, "text": "It's going to be a little bit harder."}], "words": [{"w": "We", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.06}, {"w": "just", "start": 0.06, "end": 0.22}, {"w": "bought", "start": 0.22, "end": 0.62}, {"w": "a", "start": 0.62, "end": 0.76}, {"w": "duplex", "start": 0.76, "end": 1.1}, {"w": "in", "start": 1.1, "end": 1.28}, {"w": "Florida,", "start": 1.28, "end": 1.68}, {"w": "got", "start": 2.24, "end": 2.52}, {"w": "a", "start": 2.52, "end": 2.8}, {"w": "three", "start": 2.8, "end": 3.62}, {"w": "and", "start": 3.62, "end": 3.8}, {"w": "three", "start": 3.8, "end": 4.02}, {"w": "-quarter", "start": 4.02, "end": 4.26}, {"w": "percent", "start": 4.26, "end": 4.66}, {"w": "interest", "start": 4.66, "end": 4.98}, {"w": "rate.", "start": 4.98, "end": 5.46}, {"w": "It's", "start": 5.78, "end": 5.96}, {"w": "crazy", "start": 5.96, "end": 6.32}, {"w": "because", "start": 6.32, "end": 6.66}, {"w": "the", "start": 6.66, "end": 6.82}, {"w": "builder", "start": 6.82, "end": 7.08}, {"w": "will", "start": 7.08, "end": 7.78}, {"w": "pay", "start": 7.78, "end": 7.98}, {"w": "that.", "start": 7.98, "end": 8.28}, {"w":